=== EXP010 — EXPLORATORY: coherence of MLP neurons' direct logit contributions ===
kappa = ||Σ_neurons contribution||² / Σ_neurons ||contribution||²
        ≈1 incoherent | <<1 neurons cancel each other | >1 neurons reinforce each other
indiv share = this class's Σ_neurons ||contribution||² / all classes' (before any cancellation)

